WEBVTT

00:01.120 --> 00:02.970
(June 25, AD 2096
Nara, the 9th Research Institute)

00:03.170 --> 00:04.890
How is the progress?

00:05.240 --> 00:07.600
The parasite culture is going well.

00:07.680 --> 00:09.340
(The Head of the Kudou Family, Kudou Makoto
The stability rate for the Gynoid has also

00:09.390 --> 00:11.500
(The Former Head of the Kudou Family, Kudou Retsu)
risen to 60%.

00:11.990 --> 00:15.400
The number of Parasite Dolls prototypes is 16.

00:16.490 --> 00:18.820
The cultured parasite is now

00:18.840 --> 00:22.050
to obey us
due to the effect of the Loyalty Programming,

00:22.290 --> 00:25.700
in a state of complete dormancy
among the Gynoids.

00:26.050 --> 00:27.220
Whenever the order is given,

00:27.240 --> 00:29.610
the practical test can be carried out.

00:30.480 --> 00:33.060
It's too early for the practical test.

00:33.200 --> 00:37.360
The number of tests is insufficient
to make autonomous actions.

00:38.100 --> 00:39.530
So for that...

00:39.540 --> 00:41.300
In this year's Nine Schools Competition,

00:41.370 --> 00:45.420
there's going to be a Steeplechase Cross-Country,

00:45.470 --> 00:46.520
do you know that?

00:47.010 --> 00:50.200
Then the Parasite Dolls can be tested.

00:51.140 --> 00:52.400
Right.

00:52.540 --> 00:54.300
With the Loyalty Programming,

00:54.330 --> 00:57.340
If we limit the intensity of the force,

00:57.630 --> 01:00.830
we also don't worry about
the students being seriously injured.

01:01.630 --> 01:05.810
This is the perfect opportunity
for the first operational test.

01:07.500 --> 01:10.260
(Nara, Main Residence of the Kudou Family)

01:10.710 --> 01:11.740
It's me.

01:12.230 --> 01:14.200
Grandpa, come in, please.

01:20.180 --> 01:21.400
Minoru,

01:21.650 --> 01:23.440
how is your health?

01:23.820 --> 01:25.070
I'm okay.

01:25.280 --> 01:27.210
My fever has gone down.

01:29.070 --> 01:30.740
Lie down.

01:30.830 --> 01:31.940
Grandpa.

01:32.880 --> 01:33.540
Okay.

01:37.120 --> 01:38.060
Minoru,

01:38.450 --> 01:41.400
There're a lot of absences,

01:41.460 --> 01:43.410
so you don't need to worry.

01:45.540 --> 01:49.970
Your magic is one
of the best in your generation.

01:50.180 --> 01:53.440
Among the students
who attend the Nine Schools Competition,

01:53.570 --> 01:56.330
no one can match you, right?

01:56.630 --> 01:58.360
Thank you.

01:59.140 --> 02:00.820
The Nine Schools Competition.

02:01.170 --> 02:02.900
I want to join in it.

02:04.950 --> 02:07.000
Don't look like that.

02:07.080 --> 02:08.040
Grandpa.

02:08.530 --> 02:12.110
The Nine Schools Competition
is not the only stage to test my strength.

02:13.000 --> 02:14.100
You're right.

02:14.440 --> 02:16.060
You're also smart.

02:16.700 --> 02:19.540
You can be active in the future.

02:21.500 --> 02:23.700
Well, have a good rest.

02:24.090 --> 02:26.520
In that case, your fever will go down, right?

02:26.590 --> 02:27.680
I see.

02:32.500 --> 02:36.930
The use of magicians
as weapons must be stopped.

02:38.500 --> 02:43.020
There'll never be another baby born like Minoru.

02:54.810 --> 02:59.120
(The Irregular at Magic High School S3
Steeplechase Arc)

04:14.560 --> 04:17.470
(July 2, AD 2096)

04:17.660 --> 04:20.180
The Nine Schools Competition is in a month.

04:20.800 --> 04:22.590
Is it that time already?

04:22.630 --> 04:27.290
This year, the Senior Nakajou
is working harder than ever.

04:27.430 --> 04:28.670
Is that so?

04:29.250 --> 04:32.200
It's said that she has obtained information
on strong players from other schools,

04:32.420 --> 04:35.040
and has finished selecting players
including strategies.

04:35.040 --> 04:36.540
(I'll win this year)
and has finished selecting players
including strategies.

04:36.540 --> 04:37.170
(I'll win this year)

04:38.340 --> 04:39.960
Oh, that's reliable.

04:45.040 --> 04:47.800
Ah, you two. You've worked hard.

04:48.210 --> 04:51.240
Senior Isori, what the hell happened?

04:51.600 --> 04:53.320
Well, that's...

04:53.470 --> 04:55.920
The operating committee
of the Nine Schools Competition

04:55.970 --> 04:59.230
sent over this year's highlights.

04:59.620 --> 05:01.560
So, what's the problem?

05:01.840 --> 05:05.350
The events
of the Nine Schools Competition have changed.

05:05.360 --> 05:06.860
And they're three events!

05:07.180 --> 05:10.060
It changes one month before starting

05:10.140 --> 05:12.580
is so sudden. What has changed?

05:13.570 --> 05:16.450
Speed shooting, cloud ball,

05:16.480 --> 05:18.440
and battle-board have been removed,

05:18.690 --> 05:20.600
new additions with Rower and Gunner,

05:20.640 --> 05:25.020
Shield Down,
Steeplechase Cross-Country have been added!

05:26.820 --> 05:29.840
Let alone Rower and Gunner, and Shield Down,

05:29.920 --> 05:32.070
Steeplechase Cross-Country is

05:32.260 --> 05:34.820
not a competition for high school students.

05:35.060 --> 05:38.810
In addition,
Steeplechase Cross-Country is open to

05:38.860 --> 05:41.150
all second-year and third-year boys and girls.

05:41.830 --> 05:44.440
What is the operation thinking?

05:45.770 --> 05:48.600
If we do not study the strategies very well,

05:48.720 --> 05:51.240
I'm afraid that a large number of students

05:51.460 --> 05:53.300
will end the path to becoming a magician.

05:55.450 --> 05:59.800
Tatsuya, is it real that the events
of the Nine Schools Competition have changed?

06:00.230 --> 06:01.900
Which events are added?

06:02.210 --> 06:03.880
There're three new competitions.

06:04.230 --> 06:06.500
The first is Rower and Gunner.

06:07.000 --> 06:08.980
It's a competition in which
the rower and the gunner pair up

06:09.060 --> 06:12.360
to shoot at the target in a small boat.

06:13.290 --> 06:14.940
The second is Shield Down.

06:15.190 --> 06:16.940
In a battle with shields,

06:16.970 --> 06:19.130
destroy or steal opponent's shield,

06:19.150 --> 06:22.360
or knock opponent out of the arena to win.

06:23.460 --> 06:25.020
And the third is

06:25.380 --> 06:27.480
Steeplechase Cross-Country.

06:28.010 --> 06:31.990
It's a type of military training

06:32.020 --> 06:33.600
used by the army
in mountain and forest training,

06:33.890 --> 06:37.070
and it is a cross-country obstacle race.

06:37.710 --> 06:39.160
The obstacles can be

06:39.420 --> 06:42.460
used with automated gun emplacements or magic.

06:43.030 --> 06:45.650
Oh, that sounds like fun.

06:45.680 --> 06:47.570
Especially the Shield Down.

06:47.650 --> 06:49.660
Eh, is that so.

06:49.690 --> 06:51.510
It feels a little scary.

06:51.700 --> 06:55.300
Yeah. Until last year,
the competition was one in which

06:55.460 --> 06:59.540
there was no direct conflict between players.

06:59.920 --> 07:01.960
But I think the really dangerous one is

07:02.050 --> 07:04.150
the Steeplechase.

07:04.540 --> 07:05.770
That's right.

07:05.920 --> 07:07.780
When climbing a mountain,
even if there is a path,

07:07.810 --> 07:10.210
an experienced leader is necessary.

07:10.540 --> 07:14.190
It's too reckless to compete
for speed in an unfamiliar forest.

07:14.810 --> 07:15.900
Hey, Tatsuya.

07:16.250 --> 07:18.170
The adding events this time,

07:18.400 --> 07:21.310
it seems like
there's a very strong military color.

07:21.450 --> 07:23.980
I'm afraid
it's the effect of Yokohama Disturbance.

07:24.540 --> 07:25.780
As a result of that incident,

07:25.950 --> 07:28.110
the National Defense officials recognize

07:28.270 --> 07:31.080
the military utility of magic again,

07:31.190 --> 07:34.610
and try to enrich their education in this area.

07:35.510 --> 07:39.380
The anti-magicism mass communication
has already tasted blood.

07:39.600 --> 07:40.520
Ah...

07:40.690 --> 07:43.060
Just bad timing.

07:43.260 --> 07:46.130
Why make such a change
that's easy to understand...

07:48.970 --> 07:51.170
Looks like we're going to get busy.

07:55.270 --> 07:56.530
Colonel Kazama,

07:57.000 --> 07:59.530
(The National Defense Force 101st Brigade)
This year's Nine Schools Competition events

07:59.550 --> 08:01.380
(Head: Saeki Major General)
have been completely revamped.

08:01.510 --> 08:04.700
(Head: Saeki Major General)
I heard there's an official announcement yesterday.

08:07.940 --> 08:10.980
This is the list for military training.

08:11.120 --> 08:13.960
The Magic Association,
which hosts the Nine Schools Competition,

08:14.170 --> 08:18.780
offered only formal resistance
to the National Defense's request.

08:19.070 --> 08:22.050
Did he not resist?

08:22.470 --> 08:25.370
Kudou was not opposed.

08:26.070 --> 08:29.330
For the Nine Schools Competition, our brigade

08:29.370 --> 08:31.610
received an inquiry to assist it.

08:32.280 --> 08:35.470
Not an order, but an inquiry?

08:35.500 --> 08:36.580
Yep.

08:36.840 --> 08:37.420
But,

08:38.060 --> 08:43.320
you have to consider the reason
why they brought the words to me first.

08:43.630 --> 08:49.000
The Ten Master Clans and the current state
of Japanese magic community ruled by them,

08:49.310 --> 08:53.460
the general of command also
knows that you're critical of them.

08:53.970 --> 08:57.330
The upper echelons are finally beginning to

08:57.640 --> 09:00.120
feel the danger of relying on
the Ten Master Clans, right?

09:00.620 --> 09:03.600
I plan to accept this inquiry.

09:04.000 --> 09:07.330
But, we don't use
the Independent Magic-Equipped Battalion.

09:07.930 --> 09:09.720
During the Nine Schools Competition,

09:09.930 --> 09:12.520
Colonel, your battalion is to stand by.

09:12.820 --> 09:14.090
I get it.

09:14.950 --> 09:16.710
As I mentioned earlier,

09:17.210 --> 09:21.090
Kudou not only did not oppose the event change,

09:21.250 --> 09:24.130
but showed a positive attitude.

09:24.730 --> 09:28.790
In particular, he showed a strong interest
in the Steeplechase Cross-Country,

09:29.020 --> 09:33.240
and instructed to change from representative
participation to full participation.

09:34.220 --> 09:36.350
I can't help but be surprised.

09:36.540 --> 09:37.420
Yeah.

09:37.720 --> 09:43.530
This thing seems to be a defection of Kudou,
who has always said

09:43.550 --> 09:45.930
that the use of magicians as weapons
should be stopped.

09:46.330 --> 09:48.260
But only if it's that person,

09:48.410 --> 09:51.010
it can't be that simple.

09:52.050 --> 09:54.760
There is something behind it.

09:54.990 --> 09:56.120
One more thing.

09:56.350 --> 09:59.800
In the case of Steeplechase, since the
younger sister of the head of the Kudou Family

09:59.830 --> 10:02.490
and the head of the Fujibayashi Family
get married,

10:02.720 --> 10:06.700
the two families are in step with each other
and seem to plan something.

10:07.580 --> 10:10.270
Is that the reason for standing by?

10:10.860 --> 10:11.940
Yes.

10:12.480 --> 10:14.020
While preparing for action,

10:14.080 --> 10:17.520
please keep an eye on Lieutenant Fujibayashi.

10:18.100 --> 10:18.780
Okay.

10:22.490 --> 10:26.930
Koukin, it's said that
in the Nine Schools Competition held in August,

10:27.250 --> 10:31.520
the Japanese Military
will conduct a secret test of a new weapon.

10:32.500 --> 10:34.490
A new weapon?

10:34.970 --> 10:37.790
It's called Weapon-P.

10:38.290 --> 10:42.880
Judging from the situation, it's probably
the thing that encapsulates the parasite

10:42.920 --> 10:46.060
in the automatic doll and uses its power.

10:46.310 --> 10:49.050
Reproduce the Yellow Turban Doll Warriors?

10:49.660 --> 10:51.630
They're not a fairy,

10:51.890 --> 10:55.410
do you think they can control such things?

10:55.780 --> 10:58.290
And using high school students

10:58.320 --> 11:02.660
to test performance is just stupid.

11:03.270 --> 11:06.130
Do you need me to intervene in that test?

11:06.660 --> 11:10.500
I've prepared a runaway technique
that will drive the parasite crazy.

11:10.980 --> 11:13.500
Do a tactical training on the Weapon-P.

11:14.060 --> 11:15.170
I see.

11:15.840 --> 11:18.600
You don't have to leave them unharmed,

11:18.730 --> 11:20.750
but you don't have to kill them either.

11:21.240 --> 11:23.660
To cripple the Japanese army,

11:23.870 --> 11:27.360
it is enough to get rid of their magic skills.

11:27.770 --> 11:30.500
Living as an incompetent

11:30.530 --> 11:33.830
is more painful than dying here.

11:35.360 --> 11:36.650
I see.

11:40.290 --> 11:43.500
Lord, Mr. Nakura is here.

11:48.760 --> 11:50.240
Thank you for waiting.

11:50.750 --> 11:52.690
Have a seat, please.

11:58.720 --> 11:59.640
Nakura,

12:00.110 --> 12:04.590
my lord wishes to establish
a friendship with your lord.

12:04.660 --> 12:09.200
My Lord says we can accept Zhou your proposal.

12:09.670 --> 12:13.610
Thank you for your trust.

12:14.250 --> 12:18.230
The basic conditions here
have already been covered.

12:18.440 --> 12:20.480
Of course I know.

12:20.840 --> 12:24.750
We will not do anything against Saegusa,

12:24.860 --> 12:29.510
and we do not share the same interests
as the Great Asian Union.

12:30.110 --> 12:32.200
What about the mass communication?

12:32.220 --> 12:34.510
I know that too.

12:34.820 --> 12:38.550
To control the campaign
targeting all magicians,

12:38.570 --> 12:40.670
it's already underway.

12:41.330 --> 12:42.570
I see.

12:43.240 --> 12:45.970
So let's get into the details.

12:49.380 --> 12:50.820
(The Irregular at Magic High School S3
Steeplechase Arc I)

12:51.480 --> 12:52.950
(July 8, AD 2096
Four Leaves Technology)

13:21.080 --> 13:24.090
Brother, congratulations on your

13:24.170 --> 13:26.550
complete thinking operation CAD.

13:27.140 --> 13:30.590
Thank you. It's done earlier than I thought.

13:31.300 --> 13:34.680
I was going to spend
the whole day with the test today,

13:34.710 --> 13:36.070
but my schedule is free.

13:36.690 --> 13:40.040
If you don't mind,
why don't we go somewhere together?

13:40.860 --> 13:42.610
Is that OK?

13:43.840 --> 13:45.860
Well then, I'll take your word for it.

13:46.450 --> 13:48.890
Actually, there's somewhere I'd like to go.

13:48.890 --> 13:50.290
(Shibuya Subcenter)

14:02.070 --> 14:05.250
Then, brother, please wait a moment.

14:11.250 --> 14:13.550
I'd better get away from here.

14:16.300 --> 14:18.660
Ah!? Senior Shiba!?

14:18.860 --> 14:20.980
Why are you here!?

14:21.000 --> 14:23.340
This is the girls' locker room!

14:23.350 --> 14:26.500
Kasumi, It's not a locker room
but a fitting room.

14:28.320 --> 14:31.630
Ah! Could it be that!
You come with Senior Miyuki?

14:31.640 --> 14:33.510
Where is she!?

14:35.130 --> 14:37.600
These two are here, it means...

14:38.630 --> 14:41.390
You two, what are you arguing about?

14:46.430 --> 14:48.850
Calm down, Senior Saegusa.

14:56.170 --> 14:59.450
I was wondering
what the hell was going on...

14:59.740 --> 15:01.600
Sorry to bother you.

15:01.710 --> 15:04.560
No, it's not your fault.

15:04.900 --> 15:07.330
In turn, I should apologize.

15:07.680 --> 15:11.870
Just because I took my brother
to a place like that.

15:12.250 --> 15:15.560
- I'm sorry to you and my brother.
- Em! - Wow.

15:15.590 --> 15:18.690
No, it's not Miyuki your fault.

15:19.000 --> 15:22.640
I haven't been seen naked.

15:22.650 --> 15:26.380
It's weird to be shy because it's a swimsuit.

15:27.200 --> 15:28.970
Sorry, Tatsuya,

15:29.360 --> 15:31.260
I screamed so loudly.

15:31.540 --> 15:33.850
No, I think it's normal.

15:34.480 --> 15:38.390
Senior Miyuki, do you have any plans for next?

15:38.450 --> 15:41.810
I'm just gonna see
if I could buy more clothes and go home.

15:41.840 --> 15:44.660
So, can I come along?

15:45.680 --> 15:49.210
Oh, I see. If my brother's okay.

15:49.890 --> 15:53.480
Izumi, don't bother them.

15:54.560 --> 15:59.020
Well, yes. Senior Miyuki, I was rude.

15:59.960 --> 16:01.610
Right, Izumi.

16:01.660 --> 16:05.500
It's bad to bother Senior Shiba
and Senior Shiba's date.

16:05.690 --> 16:06.630
Date!?

16:07.050 --> 16:11.320
Kasumi, we're not on a date.

16:11.350 --> 16:15.330
A high school boy
and a high school girl are shopping alone,

16:15.350 --> 16:17.960
but you said it is not a date,
which is no persuasiveness.

16:18.150 --> 16:20.100
If the high school boy is the brother,

16:20.170 --> 16:24.300
the high school girl is the sister,
I don't think it's like what you said.

16:24.380 --> 16:28.230
I think a date between brother and sister
is too unproductive!

16:28.450 --> 16:31.540
Kasumi, whatever it's rude.

16:31.540 --> 16:35.360
A good magician has an obligation
to leave the next generation!

16:35.490 --> 16:37.730
Or Senior Shiba you target your sister!

16:37.730 --> 16:38.420
- Oh!
- Kasumi.

16:40.650 --> 16:41.990
If you say that,

16:42.210 --> 16:46.020
isn't it unproductive
to spend the holidays with sisters?

16:47.040 --> 16:47.890
- Em...
- Well.

16:50.470 --> 16:51.470
- Em...
- Senior.

16:51.980 --> 16:54.050
We gonna go now.

16:54.930 --> 16:55.920
Here I'm...

16:55.950 --> 16:56.640
No,

16:56.870 --> 16:59.970
I did something childish to my juniors,

17:00.180 --> 17:01.490
so I apologize.

17:09.500 --> 17:11.300
Well. Brother.

17:11.600 --> 17:14.610
I don't think Kasumi meant any harm.

17:14.980 --> 17:16.520
I also think so.

17:17.170 --> 17:19.730
In order to stop Kasumi from going on,

17:19.780 --> 17:21.740
I used that argument.

17:22.570 --> 17:24.510
That's a little too annoying.

17:26.250 --> 17:30.540
Brother, you're not too gentle with other girls,

17:30.750 --> 17:32.420
which I like.

17:34.480 --> 17:37.970
You probably have some bad-girl qualities, too.

17:38.260 --> 17:39.080
Hum!

17:43.970 --> 17:45.120
Welcome.

17:45.290 --> 17:47.930
I'm Kudou Makoto,
the head of the Kudou Family.

17:47.970 --> 17:50.010
I'm sorry to disturb you.

17:51.110 --> 17:53.180
I'm Zhou Koukin.

17:54.030 --> 17:56.820
I have heard your fame for a long time.

17:57.220 --> 17:59.700
Zhou, you're a famous person

17:59.980 --> 18:01.290
in this area.

18:01.870 --> 18:03.120
You flatter me.

18:03.660 --> 18:07.420
To make it more convenient for you,

18:07.480 --> 18:10.030
I came here today.

18:10.400 --> 18:12.340
You mean?

18:12.850 --> 18:14.860
About the behavior of our compatriots

18:14.860 --> 18:17.530
who escaped the oppression of the Great Asian Union,

18:17.700 --> 18:20.140
I would like to consult with you.

18:20.640 --> 18:22.290
Please tell me more details.

18:22.660 --> 18:28.540
In fact, next week, we are planning
to accept three magicians from the continent,

18:28.610 --> 18:31.220
and they all have quite a lot of power.

18:31.880 --> 18:32.580
Oh.

18:33.060 --> 18:36.210
The governments of the continent
can't let them go silently,

18:36.230 --> 18:38.890
and I cannot hide them alone.

18:39.520 --> 18:43.660
Could you please welcome the Taoist masters?

18:44.580 --> 18:47.690
When people from the continent were exiled,

18:47.770 --> 18:52.060
it's customary
to stay with the traditional faction,

18:52.060 --> 18:53.720
an association of ancient magicians.

18:54.150 --> 18:58.430
The traditional people still have a grudge
against the 9th Research Institute,

18:58.520 --> 19:02.630
and we Kudou Family do not
get along well with them,

19:02.690 --> 19:04.020
is that okay?

19:04.220 --> 19:09.640
The traditional people certainly
have a duty to cooperate with us so far.

19:09.710 --> 19:12.170
However, what I have to do is

19:12.170 --> 19:17.160
provide a safe haven
for those who've escaped oppression.

19:17.930 --> 19:22.080
I have prepared a profile
of the Taoist masters here.

19:22.880 --> 19:23.990
Please take a look.

19:24.860 --> 19:28.310
To reach out to magicians
who've abandoned their homeland to seek freedom,

19:28.330 --> 19:31.730
is also the duty of the Ten Master Clans.

19:31.880 --> 19:34.890
I should be able to reply in a day or two.

19:35.280 --> 19:36.840
I appreciate that.

19:39.180 --> 19:41.460
Thank you very much for today.

19:43.820 --> 19:45.530
(Reproducing of Yellow Turban Doll Warriors)

19:48.210 --> 19:49.930
(Reproducing of Yellow Turban Doll Warriors)
Yellow Turban Doll Warriors

19:49.930 --> 19:51.280
expert?

19:51.760 --> 19:57.540
It is certainly a person I want
during the development of Parasite Dolls.

20:00.560 --> 20:02.410
It's too convenient.

20:03.930 --> 20:06.540
- Chief of security.
- Are you calling me?

20:06.820 --> 20:09.240
Delete the visit record of a person named

20:09.260 --> 20:12.730
Zhou Koukin who just visited this institute.

20:12.920 --> 20:17.050
In addition, this matter
must be kept secret from all the staff.

20:17.780 --> 20:20.930
And we can't let
the previous one know about this.

20:21.050 --> 20:21.850
All right?

20:22.350 --> 20:23.340
I see.

20:25.800 --> 20:28.090
If the information is leaked,

20:28.140 --> 20:30.260
that's a worrying development.

20:31.940 --> 20:33.310
Well, that's fine.

20:33.540 --> 20:36.010
If it's indeed a traitor,

20:36.120 --> 20:37.970
all we have to do is to get rid of him.

20:38.410 --> 20:40.720
(July 9, AD 2096)

20:40.890 --> 20:43.280
What did Zhou Koukin say?

20:43.600 --> 20:45.220
He asked the head of the Kudou Family

20:45.240 --> 20:48.520
to accept the exiles of the Great Asian Union.

20:50.390 --> 20:53.100
Well. The real reason to approach Kudou?

20:53.530 --> 20:55.660
It is to interfere with the performance test

20:55.690 --> 20:58.610
of the Parasite Possessed Combat Gynoid,
commonly known as Parasite Dolls,

20:59.140 --> 21:02.650
which is held in the Nine Schools Competition,

21:02.820 --> 21:04.740
and cause the Gynoid to be crazy

21:04.740 --> 21:07.230
and harm the players
of the Nine Schools Competition.

21:07.520 --> 21:10.840
He said they wouldn't kill them.

21:10.970 --> 21:11.880
The method is?

21:12.120 --> 21:15.180
Using a runaway technique for parasites.

21:16.290 --> 21:20.520
Is it an Outer-Systematic Magic
that interferes with spiritual beings?

21:21.380 --> 21:22.570
Thank you for your answers.

21:22.880 --> 21:24.710
Is it okay to leave it alone?

21:24.970 --> 21:26.180
It doesn't matter.

21:26.320 --> 21:28.580
The performance test of Parasite Dolls

21:28.660 --> 21:32.450
will take place during
the Steeplechase Cross-Country competition.

21:32.960 --> 21:34.930
First-year students are excluded.

21:35.420 --> 21:38.970
It's okay
as long as they don't hurt your family?

21:39.320 --> 21:43.360
Why would I bother with someone else's kids?

21:43.810 --> 21:45.240
Please forgive me for my rudeness.

21:46.080 --> 21:50.150
The hardliners of the National Defense Force
will intervene first.

21:50.740 --> 21:52.540
The test of Parasite Dolls is

21:52.620 --> 21:55.370
designed to give the masters a chance to use it

21:55.370 --> 21:58.720
and replace magicians with combat machines.

21:59.280 --> 22:04.380
It'd not make a difference
if there're one or two tricks.

22:05.020 --> 22:07.630
Even if Makoto falls into a trap,

22:07.740 --> 22:10.420
Master can find it out.

23:36.410 --> 23:40.130
(The Irregular at Magic High School S3
Steeplechase Arc II)
